\title{herbivoreTTR: Transparent functional herbivore energetics}
\description{
The package provides a small functional model that converts prescribed
dry-matter ingestion through one fixed dry-matter-basis metabolizable-energy
density into an existing one-pool gut-energy buffer. The converted energy is
an accounting equivalent, not an explicit digestion calculation. A fixed
fraction of opening gut energy is released each hour into a maintenance-only
body-energy ledger. The model separates validated dynamic state, fixed
parameters, prescribed inputs, pure conversions and transitions, and
recorded daily history.
